/* ── Runtime seam ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * The six FSM edges the DMA controller, the peripheral, and the
 * completion IRQs own (spec §synth-5-E lines 1144, 1145, 1149, 1150,
 * 1153, 1156).
 *
 * Not part of the author-visible API on spec lines 1232-1237, but
 * emitted, because omitting them does not make them unreachable — it
 * makes the pool a one-way sink. `pool_acquire_for_encode` and
 * `link_arm_rx` hand slots out; `dma-busy-tx -> free` and
 * `dma-busy-rx -> cpu-ref` are the only edges that hand them back.
 *
 * Two shapes, decided by whether the edge's source state is one the
 * API hands back as a tagged handle:
 *
